{"page":199,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:73","surah":9,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ جَـٰهِدِ ٱلْكُفَّارَ وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ وَٱغْلُظْ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ ۖ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, strive against the disbelievers and the hypocrites, and be tough with them. Hell is their final home- an evil destin-ation!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَـٰهِدِ","en_gloss":"Strive (against)","transliteration":"jāhidi","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكُفَّارَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kufāra","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"and the hypocrites","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱغْلُظْ","en_gloss":"and be stern","transliteration":"wa-ugh'luẓ","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"And their abode","transliteration":"wamawāhum","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) Hell","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"and wretched","transliteration":"wabi'sa","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"(is) the destination","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"9:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:73"}]},{"verse_key":"9:74","surah":9,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"يَحْلِفُونَ بِٱللَّهِ مَا قَالُوا۟ وَلَقَدْ قَالُوا۟ كَلِمَةَ ٱلْكُفْرِ وَكَفَرُوا۟ بَعْدَ إِسْلَـٰمِهِمْ وَهَمُّوا۟ بِمَا لَمْ يَنَالُوا۟ ۚ وَمَا نَقَمُوٓا۟ إِلَّآ أَنْ أَغْنَىٰهُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُۥ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ ۚ فَإِن يَتُوبُوا۟ يَكُ خَيْرًا لَّهُمْ ۖ وَإِن يَتَوَلَّوْا۟ يُعَذِّبْهُمُ ٱللَّهُ عَذَابًا أَلِيمًا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ وَمَا لَهُمْ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مِن وَلِىٍّ وَلَا نَصِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They swear by God that they did not, but they certainly did speak words of defiance and became defiant after having submitted; they tried to do something, though they did not achieve it, ––being spiteful was their only response to God and His Messenger enriching them out of His bounty. They would be better off turning back [to God]: if they turn away, God will punish them in this world and the Hereafter, and there will be no one on earth to protect or help them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَحْلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"They swear","transliteration":"yaḥlifūna","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(that) they said nothing","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"(that) they said nothing","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"while certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَلِمَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) word","transliteration":"kalimata","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ri","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَكَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and disbelieved","transliteration":"wakafarū","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِسْلَـٰمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their (pretense of) Islam","transliteration":"is'lāmihim","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَهَمُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and planned","transliteration":"wahammū","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"[of] what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"9:74"},{"pos":15