:77"}]},{"verse_key":"9:78","surah":9,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ سِرَّهُمْ وَنَجْوَىٰهُمْ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَّـٰمُ ٱلْغُيُوبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not realize that God knows their secrets and their private discussions? That God knows all that is hidden?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they know","transliteration":"yaʿlamū","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سِرَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their secret","transliteration":"sirrahum","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَنَجْوَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their secret conversation","transliteration":"wanajwāhum","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَّـٰمُ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿallāmu","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْغُيُوبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the unseen","transliteration":"l-ghuyūbi","verse_key":"9:78"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٨","en_gloss":"(78)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:78"}]},{"verse_key":"9:79","surah":9,"ayah":79,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَلْمِزُونَ ٱلْمُطَّوِّعِينَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ فِى ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ وَٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَجِدُونَ إِلَّا جُهْدَهُمْ فَيَسْخَرُونَ مِنْهُمْ ۙ سَخِرَ ٱللَّهُ مِنْهُمْ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is they who criticize the believers who give freely and those who can only give a little with great effort: they scoff at such people, but it is God who scoffs at them- a painful punishment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ",